WEBVTT

00:00.470 --> 00:04.800
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

00:04.800 --> 00:12.530
Asano hitogomi o nagamete coffee nondeiru
Watching a crowd in the morning, and drinking coffee

00:13.450 --> 00:21.450
Aseri nado naikano youni hitoni wa mieru daro
People must see me as if I don't have any worries

00:22.080 --> 00:29.930
lma menomae ni atomodori dekinai jikan ga
I know that the time I will never be able to get back

00:30.730 --> 00:38.220
Tashika ni nagareteru koto o watashi wa shitteru
Is moving in front of me

00:38.440 --> 00:47.450
Marude kyou shika nai toiu ikikata o shitemita toki
If I live like today is the last day of my life

00:47.730 --> 00:55.490
Saisho ni nani ga mieru darou
I wonder what I can see first

00:56.590 --> 01:00.830
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

01:01.260 --> 01:09.270
Sore ga donnani chiisana hikari demo ii
I don't care no matter how small the light is

01:09.770 --> 01:11.770
Sugata o misete hoshii
I just wish to see its shape

01:11.770 --> 01:15.970
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

01:16.630 --> 01:22.390
lma no kimochi sonomama hanaseru
I want to meet someone

01:22.390 --> 01:22.680
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest
lma no kimochi sonomama hanaseru
I want to meet someone

01:22.680 --> 01:29.150
Mermaid Forest
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Sonna hito ni deaitai
Who I can tell my honest feelings to

01:29.150 --> 01:30.980
Mermaid Forest
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology

01:40.730 --> 01:43.000
Nanny! Where are you?!
Nanny!

01:43.770 --> 01:46.260
You can't sleep, Miss Mana?

01:47.170 --> 01:49.700
Those vile voices.
They're grating on my ears.

01:50.310 --> 01:52.040
Kill them!
Such horrid creatures!

01:52.310 --> 01:56.970
It can't be helped.
Tonight is a full moon.

02:05.890 --> 02:05.980
Mermaid Does
Not Smile

02:05.980 --> 02:10.600
Episode 1
Mermaid Does
Not Smile

02:12.100 --> 02:15.120
Going to Nosurizaki?
There's no path to get to it.

02:15.700 --> 02:17.570
It's surrounded by mountains...

02:17.770 --> 02:20.530
and the shoreline's so craggy
no boat can get near it.

02:20.640 --> 02:21.240
Map of Japan

02:21.240 --> 02:23.260
Map of Japan
I guess I'm going to have to
crawl through the mountain then.

02:23.260 --> 02:23.410
Map of Japan

02:23.840 --> 02:25.380
Why are you going there?

02:25.380 --> 02:27.350
There isn't a living soul there.

02:27.450 --> 02:28.640
That's good.

02:29.010 --> 02:30.240
Seriously, why are you going there?

02:30.980 --> 02:32.350
I'm looking for something.

02:33.550 --> 02:34.750
A mermaid.

02:37.120 --> 02:40.320
Miss Mana, you have grown
to be truly beautiful.

02:40.730 --> 02:43.190
You don't know how happy I am.

02:43.660 --> 02:47.030
It was worth protecting and
nurturing you all this time.

02:47.730 --> 02:51.330
You really are in the bloom
of beauty right now.

02:51.400 --> 02:52.470
Shut up!

02:52.470 --> 02:53.700
You're repeating the same
thing day-in and day-out!

02:59.080 --> 03:02.540
<i>Held by nanny, I used to be able</i>
<i>to go out when I was a child.</i>

03:03.850 --> 03:05.250
<i>It's Miss Mana.</i>

03:05.250 --> 03:07.340
<i>She'll grow up to be beautiful.</i>

03:08.290 --> 03:12.690
<i>You've grown so much.</i>
<i>I'm not strong enough to...</i>

03:15.630 --> 03:17.030
I want to walk.

03:20.300 --> 03:26.900
Now that Miss Mana has become
15 years old, one of you must die.

03:28.510 --> 03:29.630
Ayu.

03:30.210 --> 03:31.540
It's your turn.

03:31.540 --> 03:32.910
That's right.

03:32.910 --> 03:36.140
You have lived the longest
among us all.

03:36.410 --> 03:38.810
All right, tonight...

04:09.480 --> 04:10.780
What kind of meat is this?

04:11.320 --> 04:13.940
We caught a very rare fish.

04:21.290 --> 04:22.330
<i>This is good.</i>

04:22.330 --> 04:24.300
<i>I've never had such</i>
<i>delicious fish before.</i>

04:28.870 --> 04:31.500
Is it fascinating watching me eat?

04:33.200 --> 04:35.170
I heard she wolfed it down.

04:35.470 --> 04:37.100
And she's all right?

04:37.510 --> 04:40.740
Yeah, she's as healthy
as ever after eating it.

04:42.080 --> 04:45.140
You won't be able to tell until it
reaches every part of her body...

04:45.480 --> 04:46.880
until it becomes
her flesh and blood.

04:47.550 --> 04:49.380
Trouble!
Everyone!

04:49.790 --> 04:50.960
What's the matter?

04:50.960 --> 04:53.080
A man!
There's a man!

04:53.260 --> 04:54.820
What?
A man?

05:01.030 --> 05:01.730
A village?

05:03.300 --> 05:04.830
What has brought you here?

05:06.070 --> 05:07.800
I'm not here to cause trouble.

05:08.270 --> 05:09.510
Are you lost?

05:09.510 --> 05:10.770
Are you traveling with others?

05:11.740 --> 05:13.840
Is there anyone who might look
for you, if you were to disappear?

05:14.280 --> 05:15.710
There's no one like that.

05:16.110 --> 05:16.580
I'm...

05:26.260 --> 05:27.350
He's dead.

05:27.760 --> 05:30.390
Dump him into the
Deformed Ones' pit.

05:31.060 --> 05:33.960
He'll be eaten to the last bone.

05:59.520 --> 06:03.960
This was my only good shirt,
and now its got holes.

06:06.260 --> 06:07.090
Where am I?

06:17.040 --> 06:19.200
I can go outside?

06:19.610 --> 06:22.050
Yes.
We'll carry you on this palanquin.

06:22.550 --> 06:23.080
Please.

06:23.080 --> 06:24.140
Miss Mana.

06:25.250 --> 06:26.340
Somebody!

06:27.420 --> 06:28.720
What's the matter?

06:33.860 --> 06:35.350
You...

06:35.630 --> 06:36.620
We saw you die.

06:36.960 --> 06:39.450
Hey, I have an issue with your
custom for greeting strangers.

06:40.100 --> 06:42.000
I've got a bone to pick with you...

06:42.000 --> 06:44.400
but first, I want you to
explain something to me.

06:44.900 --> 06:47.240
About this, mermaid!

06:50.840 --> 06:52.780
You insolent man.
What do you think you're doing?

06:57.620 --> 06:58.170
Kill him!

06:58.750 --> 06:59.980
Kill him, now!

07:00.290 --> 07:02.480
Give me a break,
what are you people thinking?

07:03.150 --> 07:04.020
Out of my way!

07:06.930 --> 07:07.890
Stay still.

07:08.490 --> 07:09.060
-Miss Mana!

07:09.060 --> 07:09.490
-Miss Mana!
-Miss Mana!

07:09.490 --> 07:09.960
-Miss Mana!

07:10.100 --> 07:13.390
I guess you're not feeling like
having tea and conversation.

07:13.870 --> 07:16.330
Get your hands off of her!
You must not touch Miss Mana!

07:16.570 --> 07:19.540
I can't do that.
I'm taking her hostage.

07:22.210 --> 07:23.230
What?

07:32.480 --> 07:33.540
-What are you doing?
-What are you doing?

07:34.620 --> 07:35.980
THIS is what I'm doing!

07:37.220 --> 07:38.120
Bye!

07:38.420 --> 07:39.620
Miss Mana!
Miss Mana!

07:39.620 --> 07:40.320
Miss Mana!

07:43.860 --> 07:45.450
Let me go!
Bastard!

07:45.700 --> 07:48.190
Stop it.
What if you kill me?

07:54.370 --> 07:57.640
What, they're going to kill
you along with me, aren't they?

08:06.220 --> 08:09.350
They've kept these on you
since you were a child?

08:10.050 --> 08:12.020
What the hell is going on?

08:14.490 --> 08:16.760
Does it hurt? Hang in there.

08:27.970 --> 08:30.200
We've got to do something
about that wound on your face.

08:30.910 --> 08:32.740
It's salt water, so it'll sting a bit.

08:34.080 --> 08:34.910
What?

08:35.580 --> 08:38.610
It's not much of a wound.
It'll be gone in no time.

08:40.080 --> 08:41.880
Where are we going now?

08:43.490 --> 08:47.320
Nowhere.
I finally found a mermaid.

08:47.760 --> 08:48.730
A mermaid?

08:49.260 --> 08:50.350
Although it was dead.

08:50.800 --> 08:52.290
Oh, that.

08:52.900 --> 08:55.370
What are you going to do with it?

08:55.930 --> 08:58.460
I ate mermaid flesh.

09:02.040 --> 09:06.310
Hundreds of years ago,
I was a fisherman.

09:07.450 --> 09:10.310
One day another fisherman
picked up some weird meat.

09:11.250 --> 09:13.840
<i>Isn't this the mermaid flesh</i>
<i>that I've heard so much about?</i>

09:14.190 --> 09:16.450
<i>They say it's an elixir of life.</i>

09:17.620 --> 09:19.990
So we ate it, just for fun.

09:23.290 --> 09:24.280
But...

09:29.130 --> 09:30.120
One of us died...

09:30.740 --> 09:33.600
and the next day, the other one
threw up blood and died as well.

09:34.440 --> 09:37.470
One after another, all my buddies
who ate the mermaid flesh all died.

09:38.780 --> 09:41.040
But I didn't.

09:42.510 --> 09:44.520
I got married and
went on with my life.

09:44.520 --> 09:46.480
I had completely forgotten
about the mermaids.

09:46.990 --> 09:49.010
<i>I'm afraid of you.</i>

09:49.590 --> 09:54.820
<i>I keep getting older and older,</i>
<i>but you remain young.</i>

09:57.500 --> 10:01.060
<i>Those who eat mermaid flesh obtain</i>
<i>eternal youth and immortality.</i>

10:01.900 --> 10:06.500
Not only do I have longevity, but
any fatal wound heals immediately.

10:07.710 --> 10:09.940
I'm scared of myself.

10:10.810 --> 10:12.780
<i>Go see a mermaid.</i>

10:13.010 --> 10:15.410
<i>Are you saying I can return</i>
<i>to normal if I find a mermaid?</i>

10:16.610 --> 10:18.480
<i>I don't know for certain.</i>

10:18.750 --> 10:24.310
<i>What I do know is that a mermaid</i>
<i>will be able to help you, somehow.</i>

10:27.590 --> 10:30.700
So I left the village and I've traveled
around for hundreds of years...

10:30.700 --> 10:32.790
Searching for a
mermaid to help me.

10:33.500 --> 10:36.400
The reason I came here is because
I've heard stories that a mermaid...

10:36.930 --> 10:38.730
Oh, she's fallen asleep.

10:41.310 --> 10:43.640
<i>Why...?</i>
<i>Why attack me...?</i>

10:44.510 --> 10:46.940
<i>You're our treasure, Miss Mana.</i>

10:46.940 --> 10:49.210
<i>We'll protect you with our lives.</i>

10:49.780 --> 10:53.480
<i>I don't understand.</i>
<i>Don't they care if I die?</i>

11:05.900 --> 11:07.020
A Deformed One!

11:07.130 --> 11:07.930
Deformed One?

11:13.000 --> 11:22.990
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest

11:33.460 --> 11:34.390
It's no use.

11:34.730 --> 11:37.250
The only way to kill it is by poison.

11:37.560 --> 11:38.120
Poison?

11:38.400 --> 11:38.890
Get on my back!

11:39.630 --> 11:40.770
We're going to leg it.

11:40.770 --> 11:42.430
Hold on tight!

11:52.040 --> 11:55.070
It's the same as my buddy
who turned into a monster.

11:58.520 --> 12:01.420
I'm going to go talk to them.
Wait here.

12:02.050 --> 12:03.990
I'll come too.

12:04.320 --> 12:05.620
You can't.

12:05.620 --> 12:08.110
They've kept you in those shackles
for more than 10 years, right?

12:18.000 --> 12:19.560
Just stay put.

12:19.940 --> 12:21.670
I guess you wouldn't be
able to move anyway...

12:30.280 --> 12:32.250
Where's Miss Mana?

12:32.820 --> 12:36.380
If you kill me, you won't be
able to find your Miss Mana.

12:38.660 --> 12:40.060
What do you want?

12:40.630 --> 12:43.650
I told you, I just want to
know about the mermaid!

12:45.730 --> 12:46.790
Fine.

12:47.570 --> 12:52.730
<i>The people here seem to be</i>
<i>all women, and they all look the same.</i>

12:53.640 --> 12:55.270
<i>What a strange village.</i>

12:58.280 --> 13:00.240
Who are you?

13:00.750 --> 13:03.180
For what reason are
you looking for a mermaid?

13:04.920 --> 13:06.940
There's no poison in it.

13:07.520 --> 13:09.010
It won't work on me anyway.

13:15.690 --> 13:18.390
You've eaten mermaid flesh?

13:19.200 --> 13:21.790
I want to become
a normal human again.

13:22.400 --> 13:24.800
And you think a mermaid can help you.

13:25.340 --> 13:26.460
That's what I heard.

13:26.770 --> 13:28.860
Is it so hard to have
eternal youth and immortality?

13:29.510 --> 13:32.370
If you want to die, the only thing you
need to do is have your head cut off.

13:32.740 --> 13:34.800
There's no need to find a mermaid.

13:35.450 --> 13:36.980
You've got to be kidding.

13:36.980 --> 13:39.450
I want to get old and
die the normal way.

13:39.580 --> 13:40.280
That's what I'm saying!

13:40.790 --> 13:43.150
Where's Miss Mana?

13:43.690 --> 13:46.050
You know it, don't you?
Where I can find a mermaid.

13:50.290 --> 13:53.920
I'll walk, on my own.

13:59.200 --> 14:00.570
I know I can walk.

14:02.310 --> 14:03.570
I can walk.

14:07.350 --> 14:08.570
<i>I can walk!</i>

14:09.380 --> 14:14.280
How can you put shackles on her?
What is Miss Mana to you?

14:15.420 --> 14:17.390
The Deformed One in the cave...

14:17.720 --> 14:20.710
that's what becomes of humans
who eat mermaid flesh.

14:21.290 --> 14:21.880
I'm right, aren't I?

14:22.890 --> 14:26.190
You seem to know many things, boy.

14:26.760 --> 14:29.890
Don't mess with me.
I'm 500 years old this year.

14:33.000 --> 14:34.270
Miss Mana.

14:34.270 --> 14:35.860
We've come to get you.

14:37.640 --> 14:38.470
Now.

14:38.580 --> 14:40.070
No need!
I'll walk on my own!

14:40.510 --> 14:45.280
Miss Mana is the "youth".
The youth of the women in this village.

14:46.250 --> 14:49.050
Just as a human being obtains
eternal youth and immortality...

14:49.050 --> 14:50.920
by eating mermaid flesh...

14:50.920 --> 14:54.410
a mermaid becomes young
again by eating human flesh.

14:54.990 --> 14:56.260
What?

14:56.260 --> 14:58.590
The people of this
village are all mermaids?

14:59.230 --> 15:00.420
That's a bad joke.

15:00.930 --> 15:03.800
Mermaids don't eat just any human.

15:04.270 --> 15:06.870
It has to be a girl who obtained
perpetual youth and longevity...

15:06.870 --> 15:08.410
by eating mermaid flesh.

15:08.410 --> 15:10.900
For that purpose...

15:11.140 --> 15:14.050
we go down to the human village
once every few decades...

15:14.050 --> 15:16.010
to get a baby girl.

15:17.050 --> 15:21.780
But mermaid flesh is
also a powerful poison.

15:22.020 --> 15:25.280
Most girls can't endure the
dramatic changes they go through...

15:25.520 --> 15:26.820
and some of them die.

15:27.120 --> 15:30.180
Even those who escape death
can turn into the Deformed Ones.

15:30.390 --> 15:34.260
Forced to live forever
in that wretched form.

15:39.240 --> 15:41.800
But Miss Mana is perfect.

15:42.470 --> 15:46.910
So she's been raised as your food.

15:49.710 --> 15:52.380
Give me a break!
That's disgusting!

15:52.750 --> 15:55.720
OK, now I can't give her back
to you no matter what!

15:55.850 --> 15:57.750
Let go of me!
What are you doing?

16:00.560 --> 16:01.490
Mana!

16:02.990 --> 16:03.760
How?

16:05.530 --> 16:06.000
Yuta!

16:06.530 --> 16:08.050
I'm sorry to say this...

16:08.170 --> 16:12.100
but there probably isn't a way for
you to return to being normal again.

16:12.800 --> 16:13.270
What?

16:13.670 --> 16:16.110
"A mermaid will be able
to help you somehow"...

16:16.470 --> 16:20.380
that means that you can die
by taking mermaid poison.

16:21.010 --> 16:22.480
Mermaid poison?

16:22.650 --> 16:27.380
The poison is made by rotting a
mermaid carcass in poisonous herb.

16:27.790 --> 16:30.550
A generous amount was
rubbed on to that harpoon.

16:31.020 --> 16:32.720
So you can die this time!

16:33.890 --> 16:35.860
Let go!
Let go!

16:37.030 --> 16:39.220
I can't die here!

16:46.170 --> 16:47.330
Mana, the fire!

16:53.640 --> 16:54.650
What are we going to do?

16:54.650 --> 16:56.310
No need to fret.

16:56.410 --> 16:58.110
He doesn't have long to live.

16:58.320 --> 17:01.280
Left alone, Miss Mana
is as helpless as a baby.

17:01.890 --> 17:04.820
She won't be able
to leave this village.

17:05.760 --> 17:07.050
They were going to eat me?

17:07.220 --> 17:08.460
I can't believe that.

17:08.460 --> 17:10.190
Neither can I.

17:10.660 --> 17:13.530
And even more, I don't want to
believe that they're mermaids.

17:15.600 --> 17:17.570
All my hopes and dreams...gone.

17:20.940 --> 17:22.460
I smell the ocean.

17:22.610 --> 17:25.840
All the caves in this area
must be connected to the ocean.

17:26.540 --> 17:29.840
Yes, Nanny said that's why
the Deformed Ones wail.

17:30.050 --> 17:32.050
Because they're being
chased out of the rising water...

17:32.050 --> 17:35.750
on nights of the full and new moon,
when the tide becomes full.

17:37.490 --> 17:40.790
The wound's not healing.
The poison is taking effect.

17:45.500 --> 17:46.090
Mana.

17:48.030 --> 17:49.730
I'll suck it out.

17:55.910 --> 17:58.470
Hey, are you dead?

18:05.420 --> 18:07.410
What do we do?
Go in and look for them?

18:07.890 --> 18:10.580
No, the caves are all interconnected.

18:10.820 --> 18:12.880
We could run into a
Deformed One at any time.

18:13.060 --> 18:16.750
But what if Miss Mana gets
eaten by a Deformed One?

18:17.390 --> 18:19.290
We could open the floodgate.

18:19.830 --> 18:24.670
There's only one outlet, the ocean.
We'd just have to wait there.

18:25.140 --> 18:28.110
If we opened the floodgate,
the village will sink under water.

18:28.210 --> 18:30.210
But if we don't eat now...

18:30.210 --> 18:33.540
we don't even know for how many
more centuries we'll have to wait.

18:33.910 --> 18:35.540
Now is our only chance.

18:40.720 --> 18:41.780
Deformed Ones!

18:45.720 --> 18:46.550
Deformed Ones?

19:04.480 --> 19:05.130
Mana!

19:12.380 --> 19:14.150
It's coming.

19:24.660 --> 19:25.130
<i>Mermaids?</i>

19:35.340 --> 19:37.600
<i>Their faces change into</i>
<i>that of the woman they eat.</i>

19:37.840 --> 19:39.640
<i>That's why they all look the same.</i>

19:59.830 --> 20:01.700
Let them eat you!

20:05.100 --> 20:06.690
Get away!!

20:07.840 --> 20:09.910
What's going to become
of you even if you survive?

20:09.910 --> 20:11.810
Let them eat you!

20:12.340 --> 20:13.780
Nothing is going to eat me!

20:17.210 --> 20:20.050
Compared to the agony
of living forever...

20:20.050 --> 20:23.190
being cut off from all human
contact and roaming about...

20:23.190 --> 20:26.160
it will be so much easier
to die here and now.

20:27.120 --> 20:28.490
I want to live.

20:28.760 --> 20:29.780
I'm going to live.

20:37.370 --> 20:39.170
It's too late now.

20:41.440 --> 20:43.570
They've gone back to
their true mermaid form.

20:43.570 --> 20:46.080
They failed to eat Miss Mana.

20:46.080 --> 20:48.480
They won't be able to
assume human form again.

20:49.710 --> 20:50.680
Old woman.

20:51.220 --> 20:57.210
I'm a human being who ate
mermaid flesh, the same as you two.

20:59.760 --> 21:05.200
But there was no place but here
for an old woman like myself to live.

21:06.030 --> 21:09.370
The only thing I could do was
to live among the mermaids.

21:09.370 --> 21:13.700
Deprived of any pleasure,
happiness, or even sadness.

21:15.110 --> 21:17.300
I'm taking Mana.

21:21.450 --> 21:27.610
I'm staying here with them.
Until I rot away.

21:46.240 --> 21:54.750
Mukashi no koto datowa mada katazuke rarenai
It's just something in the past, but I still can't forget it

21:56.120 --> 22:04.630
ltsumade kakaruno to anata wa warau kedo
"How long does it take?" You smiled at me

22:06.090 --> 22:14.980
Dorekurai oboete iru hidoku naki nagara
How much do you remember? I cried hard

22:15.980 --> 22:25.490
Dorekurai oboete iru anokoto to ieba
How much do you remember if I talk about "that thing"?

22:30.620 --> 22:39.630
ltsumademo mada utsumuite
I still look down

22:40.580 --> 22:49.090
Tobikoe rarenai mizutamari
I can't jump over the puddle

22:50.230 --> 22:59.730
Wakaranakunaru moshikasuruto
I'm confused

23:00.080 --> 23:09.570
Kawarenai no wa watashi dake kana
Maybe I'm the only one who still can't change

23:14.560 --> 23:24.090
Mukashi no koto datowa mada katazuke rarenai
It's just something in the past, but I still can't forget it

23:26.600 --> 23:30.230
But you know, you can have
some fun in life, once in a while.

23:30.840 --> 23:34.300
Well, my life's been so long I don't
know if I can even call it a "life".

23:35.480 --> 23:37.340
Are there tough times too?

23:37.580 --> 23:38.510
Sometimes.

23:38.820 --> 23:43.010
But maybe it's not too bad to
keep living until we get tired of it.

23:44.020 --> 23:48.820
Maybe we'll be able to find a
completely different kind of mermaid.

23:50.690 --> 23:53.320
Someone who will be able to help.

23:54.200 --> 23:57.260
She'll tell us the way
to return to normal.

24:06.140 --> 24:09.200
On the water, a memory of the
distant past comes flooding back.

24:09.750 --> 24:13.580
Washed ashore, I meet Rin, the
daughter of the leader on Toba Island.

24:13.580 --> 24:15.550
And I decide to stay on the
island for the time being.

24:15.950 --> 24:19.320
The leader of the pirates and
his wife, Isago, are enemies to Rin.

24:19.760 --> 24:22.030
They threaten me to find out
where the mermaids live.

24:22.030 --> 24:24.080
Both of them wanting to obtain
eternal youth and immortality.

24:25.500 --> 24:28.990
I won't die. No, Rin!
Don't attack her!

